menu "WiFi Dap target flash debug"

    config BIRDIEBOT_TARGET_FLASH_DEBUG_HTTP
        bool "Enable /tf bring-up HTTP endpoint (lab verification only)"
        default n
        help
            Registers a minimal POST-only HTTP endpoint on the existing web
            server for hardware bring-up and lab verification without the Web
            UI:

              POST /tf/probe    probe the SWD target, return JSON info
              POST /tf/status   return the current status snapshot
              POST /tf/flash    body = raw image, program+verify+reset, return
                                JSON with expected/actual SHA-256 and timings
              POST /tf/abort    abort a running flash
              POST /tf/pc       halt, read the target PC, resume (reset check)

            Requests need the normal web Host/Origin guard (web_host_guard)
            and an extra "X-WiFi Dap-Target-Flash: 1" header.  The endpoint
            calls the same blocking engine API as the production Web flow, so
            it must only be enabled on a trusted LAN during bring-up.
            Default: n (production builds contain no endpoint code).

endmenu
